  "interpretation_zh_tw": "PR 事件改用 event payload 的 exact head SHA；非 PR 事件回到 github.sha。完整 Git history 與每個 outgoing commit 的 merge／payload gate 保持原樣。這避免 synthetic merge 成為被審查的 source history；不是放寬 merge 政策。",
  "official_primary_sources": [
    {
      "url": "https://github.com/actions/checkout/tree/v4#checkout-pull-request-head-commit-instead-of-merge-commit",
      "supports": "Checkout v4 officially documents pull_request.head.sha for checking PR head rather than synthetic merge."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/events-that-trigger-workflows#pull_request",
      "supports": "pull_request default GITHUB_SHA/GITHUB_REF describe the synthetic merge; head.sha selects head commit."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/contexts",
      "supports": "A nonexistent context property evaluates to an empty string."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/expressions",
      "supports": "Empty string is falsy; logical OR supports the github.sha fallback."
    }
  ],
  "limits_zh_tw": [
    "尚未執行修正後的 GitHub workflow；新的 CI conclusion 待 root push 後查驗。",
    "本 CI 的 checkout scope 是 exact head source／method audit，不宣稱合成 merge integration testing 已通過。",
    "workflow 是 source closure 的一部分；package01 不能靜默改綁新 revision，必須保留並建立新 blocked package02。",
    "沒有改變 resource blocker、human approval、physics contract、scientific cuts、PDF binding 或 publication gate。"
